OL,4,CFiona Harvey to appear at Crown Court  
OL,5,Con harassment charge                   
OL,6,GA woman who allegedly inspired the     
OL,7,Gstalker character Martha in the hit    
OL,8,GNetflix drama Baby Reindeer is to      
OL,9,Gappear at Harrow Crown Court on        
OL,10,Gcharges of racially aggravated         
OL,11,Gharassment without violence.           
OL,13,FFiona Harvey, 61, is accused of        
OL,14,Fsending several emails and three       
OL,15,Fvoicemails including antisemitic       
OL,16,Fmaterial to lawyer Mark Lewis, between 
OL,17,F4 September and 9 October 2025.        
